ase turrets to defend against the hive's attacks and protect the four-leaf clover from harm.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take up excavators, chainsaws, or pile drivers to dig downward and collect mineral deposits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Choice: Humanity or Instinct</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are both the infected and the savior; a beast, yet carrying the flame of human wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk the razor's edge between destruction and rebirth, madness and reason.<br>Protect this faint green shimmer of hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615890/extras/b959bc36bc6a9bf89a38ec2dc6918cfe.poster.avif?t=1758882901\" width=770 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615890/extras/b959bc36bc6a9bf89a38ec2dc6918cfe.webm?t=1758882901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615890/extras/b959bc36bc6a9bf89a38ec2dc6918cfe.mp4?t=1758882901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Elder\u2026 sometimes I can't tell\u2014am I a fox infected with human DNA, or a human trapped inside the body of a fox?)</p>","developers":["ISLUO"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3615890/0e35ecc6f26a255c3dd782cd695bbac03ea578c2/header.jpg?t=1758882901","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3615890/2108475146/d